<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH POWER UTILITY Q1 PROFIT FLAT.</title>
<headline>CZECH POWER UTILITY Q1 PROFIT FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three month period</p>
<p>ending March 31, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> Gross profit		   108.93   vs	    108.59</p>
<p> Operating profit	     113.69   vs	    104.67</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		 1,516.37   vs	  1,500.72</p>
<p> Output			 1,540.78   vs	  1,532.52</p>
<p> Total assets		 6,197.23   vs	  4,872.04</p>
<p> Basic capital		1,605.62   vs	  1,605.62</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is Zapadoceska Energetika</p>
<p>a.s. . The firm is a regional electricity distributor</p>
<p>based in the western city of Plzen. Its shares are traded on</p>
<p>the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE). Results</p>
<p>were provided by the PSE.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
